//? Title: Polynomial long division: actual prime-field cancellations
//? Subtitle: Actual canonical histories, retained original fixtures and explicit controls
//? Exports: both
//? Lang: en-GB

\abstract(
A leading quotient term cancels the actual leading term of the working dividend.
The native producer now captures its own before/after coefficient vectors and
quotient storage. No second division runs in the report. Coefficients are
low-degree first, normalized into the validated prime field; the zero polynomial
is an empty vector. The original GF(7) dividend and quadratic divisor remain as
a controlled exact-arithmetic example. )

\toc

> Mechanism and mathematical scope

$$ a=q b+r\pmod p,\qquad r=0\ \text{or}\ \deg r<\deg b. $$

> A tiny actual producing history

The table and native concept diagram read the same producing execution. Every
block below is a complete editable C++ program.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/polynomial_long_division_tiny.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
#include <datamunge/plot/plot.hpp>
#include <datamunge/plot/diagram.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/modular_exponentiation.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/integer_arithmetic.hpp>
#include <filesystem>
#include <print>
#include <algorithm>
#include <cmath>
#include <limits>
#include <climits>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/number_theory.hpp>
#include <numeric>
#include <numbers>
#include <random>
#include <string>
#include <vector>
#include <map>
#include <set>
#include <array>
#include <tuple>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/prufer.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/flow_diagram.hpp>
#include <datamunge/algorithms/polynomial_gf.hpp>
int main() {
    namespace a = dm::algorithms;
    namespace g = dm::graphics;
    std::filesystem::create_directories("build");

    auto t = a::poly_divmod_gf_trace({1, 0, 1}, {1, 1}, 7);
    std::print("\n| actual shift | quotient coefficient | before | after | quotient storage |\n| ---: | " "---: | --- | --- | --- |\n");
    for (const auto &s : t.steps)
        std::print("| {} | {} | `{}` | `{}` | `{}` |\n", s.shift, s.coefficient,
                   s.before, s.after, s.quotient);

    g::Diagram d;
    d.node("n0", {0, 0},
           std::format("Actual first cancellation\nshift {}, coefficient {}",
                       t.steps[0].shift, t.steps[0].coefficient));
    d.node("n1", {10, 0},
           std::format("Actual final quotient\n{}", t.result.quotient));
    d.node("n2", {20, 0},
           std::format("Actual final remainder\n{}", t.result.remainder));
    d.edge("n0", "n1").edge("n1", "n2");
    d.save_svg("build/polynomial_long_division_tiny.svg");
}
```
