| actual shift | quotient coefficient | before | after | quotient storage |
| ---: | ---: | --- | --- | --- |
| 1 | 1 | `[1, 0, 1]` | `[1, 6]` | `[0, 1]` |
| 0 | 6 | `[1, 6]` | `[2]` | `[6, 1]` |
